830 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 459 0 R
/E (In this project, we successfully got the 4-wheel chassis to function and managed to make individual sensors work. However, we faced several challenges that prevented full integration. One major issue was an unstable power supply due to the absence of a stationary source, leading to possible overloads. Using a single 12V battery pack to power multiple 12V outputs may have contributed to this problem. Additionally, our ESP32 module burned out twice, likely due to power inconsistencies or mismanagement. Another key factor was our limited experience in designing large and complex circuits within a compact space, which made proper wiring and power distribution difficult.)
/Pg 42 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
831 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 459 0 R
/E (Despite these setbacks, the project provided valuable learning experiences in hardware troubleshooting, power management, and circuit design, which will help in future developments.)
/Pg 42 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
